WEBVTT

00:00:05.090 --> 00:00:06.450
Hi there!

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:07.650
I'm Sakuya Aizawa...

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:08.900
<b>Sakuya Aizawa</b>

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:12.030
And this is my partner, 
Isumi Saginomiya!

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.280
<b>Isumi Saginomiya</b>

00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:16.390
So, Isumi-san, time to 
introduce ourselves.

00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:19.520
This is our chance to show 
off how funny we are!

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:20.650
Right...

00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:23.650
Come on, you must have something! 
Like a favorite punishment game...

00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:24.910
"Punishment"?

00:00:24.910 --> 00:00:26.520
Yeah, there are lots!

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:29.210
Thai kicks, bungee jumping, 
rubber band snapping...

00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:31.730
Then... The rubber band—

00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:33.590
Okay! Rubber band snapping, eh?

00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:38.430
Don't let go.

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:40.590
If you let go, it's all over.

00:00:40.590 --> 00:00:42.760
You can't let go, no matter what!

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:20.360
Mother,

00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:23.700
why don't I have a maid?

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:28.330
Nagi and Sakuya have 
maids, but I don't.

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:30.960
I'm already fourteen.

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:33.590
I should have a maid or two by now...

00:02:33.590 --> 00:02:37.170
Isumi-chan, maids are not something

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:40.050
you automatically acquire 
at a certain age.

00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:44.010
Though, that is an interesting idea.

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:46.470
The duty of a maid

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:49.640
is to support her master in areas 
where he or she is lacking.

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:52.150
Nagi-chan is unable to live 
day-to-day on her own,

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:53.810
and Sakuya-chan...

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:56.780
Well, I'm sure she has many failings.

00:02:56.780 --> 00:02:58.650
Who has many failings?!

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:02.660
Oh, Sakuya-chan, welcome.

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:03.820
Thanks.

00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:04.910
I understand.

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:10.410
I don't have a maid because, unlike 
Sakuya and Nagi, I am responsible.

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:11.920
Don't come to your own understanding!

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:14.170
But I understand, too.

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:18.380
I will find someone who will 
make a wonderful maid

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:20.130
for a responsible girl like you.

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:29.140
So, please help me find 
a maid for Isumi-chan.

00:03:30.270 --> 00:03:31.890
Why did you come to me for this?

00:03:31.890 --> 00:03:36.150
If I must have a reason... 
I just did, I suppose.

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:39.530
So there is no reason, then.

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:42.400
But Isumi-san is a responsible girl.

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:45.070
She doesn't need a maid, does she?

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:48.700
You just don't want her to know
 that you don't want to look.

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:51.250
Don't blurt out the truth like that...

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:55.580
As you say, Isumi-chan is 
indeed a responsible girl...

00:03:56.290 --> 00:03:57.840
But she has one weakness.

00:03:58.130 --> 00:03:59.760
One weakness?

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:01.840
You sure it's only one?

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:05.340
Isumi-chan's weakness is...

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:09.140
Smapho ability!

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:12.140
S-Smapho ability?

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:14.230
Smartphone-using ability.

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:17.560
If that's too confusing, 
you can call it "iAbility."

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:19.650
That's even more confusing.

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:23.360
In other words, since Isumi 
can't use smartphones,

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:26.370
you want to give her a maid who 
can teach her how to use them.

00:04:26.570 --> 00:04:28.120
I knew you'd get it, Nagi-chan.

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:31.580
Does she really need a maid for that?

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:36.000
Dunno. But this'll be a pain, so 
just help her until she gets bored.

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:37.790
What?!

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:42.340
Then, let's try handing out 
flyers to recruit maids.

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:44.010
All right.

00:04:44.010 --> 00:04:47.800
<b>Recruiting Maids!! 
Hourly Pay: X,XXX~
Applicants must be proficient in use of <u>smartphones</u>.</b>

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:47.800
But I wonder if any maids 
will respond to this...

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:50.260
Look at this, Sharna-chan!

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:53.180
I found a flyer about recruiting maids!

00:04:53.180 --> 00:04:54.980
So I see, Fumi-chan.

00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:57.480
And check out the pay!

00:04:57.480 --> 00:05:01.230
I can't hide my excitement 
at this huge amount!

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:02.820
Nothing less from you, Fumi-chan.

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:07.360
But it says that applicants must be 
proficient in the use of smartphones.

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:08.740
<b>Recruiting Maids!! 
Hourly Pay: X,XXX~
Applicants must be proficient in use of <u>smartphones</u>.</b>

00:05:07.360 --> 00:05:08.280
Will you be okay?

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:11.370
No need to worry!

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:13.700
This job has big money on the line!

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:14.960
I just have to cover up

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:17.170
for slight disadvantages 
with love, courage, and effort!

00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:20.420
I'm going for it, Sharna-chan!

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:24.970
Will she be okay?

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:27.180
Oh, well...

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:31.350
<b>Isumi-chan's 
Maid Candidates</b>

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:32.010
And so, with Hayate-sama's cooperation,

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:34.140
and after careful screening,

00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:38.600
I have found a maid perfectly 
suited to Isumi-chan's personality,

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:40.560
who is also brimming 
with smapho ability.

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:44.740
Isumi-chan's maid 
shall be... this person!

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:47.820
Hello! I'm Fumi Hibino!

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:50.740
As your maid starting today, 
I'll bring you down with one blow!

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:57.330
Mother, this is just a hunch, but...

00:05:57.330 --> 00:05:58.960
I'm pretty sure she is...

00:05:57.960 --> 00:05:59.250
You're down!

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:01.590
a dud.

00:06:01.590 --> 00:06:02.670
Don't worry.

00:06:01.590 --> 00:06:04.340
You're down! You're down! Down in one blow!

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:07.510
I knew the moment I saw her

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:09.720
that she was the only one for the job.

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:13.970
What part of her made you 
reach that conclusion?

00:06:14.260 --> 00:06:17.430
Well, just look at her eyes, Isumi-chan.

00:06:14.260 --> 00:06:17.430
You're down! You're down! You're down!

00:06:17.430 --> 00:06:20.980
Doesn't she look just like this emoticon?

00:06:17.430 --> 00:06:20.980
You're down! You're down!

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:26.070
Please don't decide based 
on something like that...

00:06:26.070 --> 00:06:28.450
You just don't understand.

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:33.120
Her smapho ability has turned 
her face into a emoticon.

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:35.910
There is no one more qualified.

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:40.170
Wait, just what kinds of 
qualifications were you looking for?

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:42.790
She's not a very good 
judge of character...

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:43.670
You said it.

00:06:44.090 --> 00:06:45.050
Both of you!

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:48.170
Please don't fight over me!

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:55.560
I just have to prove to you how 
much smapho ability I have.

00:06:55.860 --> 00:06:58.390
Uh, is that what this was about?

00:06:58.390 --> 00:07:01.150
Let's just overlook that this time.

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:03.020
Just so you know,

00:07:03.020 --> 00:07:06.400
I can perform the same 
tasks as a smartphone,

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:07.860
without even using a smartphone!

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:09.400
For example, voice recognition!

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:12.990
Oh, I've seen that in commercials!

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:15.910
Give it a try, Isumi-chan.

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:19.250
Th-Then, what is DTTV?

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:21.620
Google it, idiot.

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:25.750
Looks like that's the 
end of the maid hunt.

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:27.590
What was all this?

00:07:29.210 --> 00:07:31.010
I'm home.

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:33.180
How'd it go with Isumi?

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:36.760
In the end, we couldn't 
find a maid for her.

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:41.980
But, I wonder why Isumi-san 
doesn't have her own maid...

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:45.230
Probably because she doesn't need one.

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:51.150
Someone who looks after her, but is 
meddlesome and worries too much...

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:53.860
Who's annoying because she 
sticks her nose in everything...

00:07:54.490 --> 00:07:58.870
Who tells her to listen, 
but won't listen to her in return,

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:02.370
but is always on her 
side no matter what...

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:05.460
She already has a mother like that.

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:07.710
Mother...

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:09.630
What is it, Isumi-chan?

00:08:09.630 --> 00:08:12.380
The smartphone is trembling.

00:08:09.630 --> 00:08:13.880
<b>Sakuya</b>

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:13.880
I think it's broken.

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:16.220
Well then, throw it away.

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:17.050
Okay.

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:20.640
<b>Commercial Connecting Theater</b>

00:08:18.930 --> 00:08:20.640
Commercial Connecting Th—

00:08:20.640 --> 00:08:22.230
Ta-da!

00:08:22.230 --> 00:08:26.900
I have finally obtained the cutting 
edge of technology: a smartphone!

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:28.400
Wh-What?!

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:33.150
Now I can enjoy the smart, 
beautiful, high-tech functions that

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:36.780
old cell phones with all 
those buttons can't do!

00:08:36.780 --> 00:08:38.410
Wow!

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:40.700
But what kind of high-tech 
functions do you want to enjoy?

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:43.080
The phone function, of course!

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:45.920
Old cell phones can do that...

00:08:46.130 --> 00:08:48.380
Also texting!

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:51.260
Old cell phones can do that...

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:54.880
<b>Commercial Connecting Theater</b>

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:54.880
It's Commercial Connecting Theater!

00:08:55.270 --> 00:08:59.610
If you have a smartphone, 
you've gotta put apps on it.

00:08:59.610 --> 00:09:00.680
Apps?

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:05.210
Yeah. They're kind of like 
software on a computer.

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:09.160
You can check the weather, 
tweet 140-character messages...

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:10.690
I'll download some for you.

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:14.400
What kinds of things 
would you like apps for?

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:15.570
Let's see...

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:17.910
Then, first of all, a manual.

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:20.160
Put a manual app on it.

00:09:20.800 --> 00:09:23.060
I want to read the 
manual app thoroughly

00:09:23.060 --> 00:09:26.060
so I can learn how to call and text.

00:09:26.680 --> 00:09:30.170
<i>I think it'd be faster to read 
the manual that came with it...</i>

00:09:31.660 --> 00:09:33.760
Hey, Haru-san!

00:09:34.070 --> 00:09:34.910
Yes?

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:37.760
What's the matter, Sakuya-san?

00:09:38.320 --> 00:09:41.640
I don't like this one. 
Bring me the black one.

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:46.480
Sakuya-san, at least put something 
on before you call me.

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:48.080
It's immodest.

00:09:49.470 --> 00:09:51.270
This has happened before!

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:56.030
It was this exact same situation!

00:09:57.010 --> 00:09:59.530
Hey! Makita! Kunieda!

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:00.820
Yes?

00:10:00.820 --> 00:10:04.080
What's the matter, Miss Sakuya?

00:10:04.460 --> 00:10:07.830
I don't like this one. 
Bring me the black one.

00:10:08.740 --> 00:10:13.460
Miss! At least put something 
on before you call us!

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:15.920
What's with you all of a sudden?

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:17.240
This isn't good.

00:10:17.240 --> 00:10:20.090
Yes. This is a grave concern.

00:10:20.530 --> 00:10:23.100
The mistress is almost 14.

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:25.350
I thought she would be 
a child forever, but...

00:10:25.760 --> 00:10:29.350
It appears she has grown remarkably lately.

00:10:29.840 --> 00:10:30.730
Huh?

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:32.290
Uh, nothing...

00:10:32.950 --> 00:10:36.110
Anyway, if it's come to this,
 we have no choice but to do <i>that</i>.

00:10:36.480 --> 00:10:38.490
No choice but to what?

00:10:38.790 --> 00:10:42.910
We will have a maid hired 
for you immediately.

00:10:43.290 --> 00:10:44.910
Huh? A maid?

00:10:45.320 --> 00:10:51.630
Yes. We've begun a groundbreaking 
project to find the perfect maid for you.

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:55.750
<b>Maid Café
Saku-nyan</b>

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:59.170
First of all, the sign pisses me off.
 Would you change it?

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:05.560
I can pretty much see exactly 
how you think, though...

00:11:06.510 --> 00:11:10.060
How much money did you spend 
just to find me a maid?

00:11:10.460 --> 00:11:13.230
But this way, we can see her ability,

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:16.360
and more importantly, what her 
work style and character are like.

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:18.240
Are you serious?

00:11:19.380 --> 00:11:21.740
I don't see any that really 
stand out, though.

00:11:22.060 --> 00:11:23.690
That's not true at all!

00:11:23.690 --> 00:11:26.240
Look, as you said that, 
a new girl arrived!

00:11:28.060 --> 00:11:30.290
Uh, no. She's not it.

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:31.500
Why not?

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:33.830
She looks serious and 
quite cute, doesn't she?

00:11:34.260 --> 00:11:35.920
Cute is fine,

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:41.790
but it'll be depressing to have to 
look at that dull face all day.

00:11:43.540 --> 00:11:46.510
If someone wants to be my maid,

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:48.740
she should be more bright and cheerful,

00:11:48.740 --> 00:11:52.940
and most of all, she's gotta be funny 
enough to make me do a spit-take.

00:11:54.110 --> 00:11:56.820
Welcome home, Master!

00:11:58.700 --> 00:12:04.070
What'll it be today? Coffee, tea, or...

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:05.570
My smile?

00:12:07.860 --> 00:12:10.020
Well, she's bright and 
cheerful, isn't she?

00:12:10.020 --> 00:12:12.830
And you just did a 
spit-take, didn't you?

00:12:13.090 --> 00:12:16.690
Y-You're right... That was funny...

00:12:17.110 --> 00:12:20.340
But just being funny isn't 
enough to be my maid!

00:12:20.340 --> 00:12:22.470
She's gotta be a quick 
and efficient worker.

00:12:25.650 --> 00:12:27.030
She's doing it!

00:12:27.030 --> 00:12:28.970
She's quite talented!

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:33.600
I... just remembered 
something I have to do!

00:12:34.210 --> 00:12:36.250
So I'll be going out.

00:12:36.250 --> 00:12:38.030
What? Miss?

00:12:40.710 --> 00:12:43.030
What's wrong, Sakuya-san?

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:46.840
Bright, cheerful, talented, and funny.

00:12:47.300 --> 00:12:48.000
Pardon?

00:12:48.590 --> 00:12:50.490
Why are you a guy?!

00:12:50.840 --> 00:12:53.540
Why do you have to be 
a butler, not a maid?!

00:12:53.820 --> 00:12:55.290
Huh... What?

00:12:55.660 --> 00:12:57.960
I wouldn't mind you being a maid.

00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:02.380
Given the choice, I'd prefer that, too.

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:09.680
Anyway, why did you come over 
here with such a gloomy face?

00:13:10.030 --> 00:13:11.950
Why...?

00:13:11.950 --> 00:13:14.950
Hey, why did you hire 
the butler who's in debt?

00:13:15.500 --> 00:13:19.570
Um, do you have some problem 
with my skill as a butler?

00:13:20.250 --> 00:13:22.880
Oh, no, no! That's not it!

00:13:22.880 --> 00:13:27.720
I mean, he's your butler now, but he 
was a total stranger at first, right?

00:13:27.720 --> 00:13:31.320
But still, you made him your butler 
without knowing his abilities.

00:13:31.320 --> 00:13:32.450
It was fate.

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:36.700
I met my fate that day.

00:13:37.360 --> 00:13:38.710
That's all.

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:44.160
Fate, huh?

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:47.970
<b>The fate of the Earth has 
been entrusted to your gun!</b>

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:49.880
<i>She's got a point.</i>

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:51.980
<i>Without something like that,</i>

00:13:51.980 --> 00:13:54.510
<i>no one could be with a total 
stranger all the time.</i>

00:13:56.490 --> 00:14:00.310
<i>I just put money in without thinking...
 How do I play this?</i>

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:03.360
Uh, I think I... Huh?

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:06.730
Shake the gun lightly to load it.

00:14:07.900 --> 00:14:10.140
The front button throws a hand grenade.

00:14:11.210 --> 00:14:13.130
<i>She's the one from...</i>

00:14:13.640 --> 00:14:17.250
It's unusual to see a cute girl
 playing this game alone,

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:19.750
so I couldn't resist joining in...

00:14:20.190 --> 00:14:21.500
Have I disturbed you?

00:14:21.910 --> 00:14:24.380
Uh, no! Not at all!

00:14:24.660 --> 00:14:27.260
<i>That accent... She's from Kansai?</i>

00:14:27.970 --> 00:14:29.390
Well then, shall we?

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:32.360
This is my first time, though.

00:14:32.360 --> 00:14:34.870
I might die pretty fast.

00:14:34.870 --> 00:14:36.460
You won't die.

00:14:37.650 --> 00:14:39.400
I'll protect you.

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:45.010
<i>Did she not get the reference?</i>

00:14:46.010 --> 00:14:47.240
Okay, let's go.

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:48.150
O-Okay!

00:15:00.220 --> 00:15:01.250
<i>Wow...</i>

00:15:01.470 --> 00:15:04.250
Be careful. He'll come back to life!

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:05.460
Okay!

00:15:07.020 --> 00:15:07.920
Very good!

00:15:08.230 --> 00:15:09.480
Let's keep going!

00:15:09.480 --> 00:15:10.050
Okay!

00:15:17.460 --> 00:15:18.680
This is the last one!

00:15:22.030 --> 00:15:23.400
We did it!

00:15:24.750 --> 00:15:27.030
Looks like we managed to beat it.

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:29.360
But you were very good.

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:31.160
You picked it up quickly, too.

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:33.490
Not really...

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:36.620
A scary game like this 
really isn't for girls, though.

00:15:37.020 --> 00:15:40.250
Even a girl can spare two 
coins to work off stress

00:15:41.150 --> 00:15:44.880
by blasting some ugly 
two-dimensional zombies, right?

00:15:45.390 --> 00:15:49.510
Besides, we protected the world's 
peace from the evil zombies.

00:15:50.480 --> 00:15:51.720
Just imaginary ones, though.

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:56.580
Yes, being zombies, they come 
back to life with one reset.

00:16:00.430 --> 00:16:02.430
I-I'm sorry!

00:16:02.430 --> 00:16:04.350
I'll be going now.

00:16:05.480 --> 00:16:07.480
Hey, don't just leave me here.

00:16:08.210 --> 00:16:10.700
I love funny people.

00:16:10.700 --> 00:16:12.740
So wait for me, my maid.

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:14.010
What?

00:16:15.850 --> 00:16:17.660
Yeah, that did happen!

00:16:17.880 --> 00:16:20.410
Sakuya-san, you 
reminisced for too long.

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:23.290
I can't help it. It was fate.

00:16:23.600 --> 00:16:24.430
Sorry?

00:16:25.170 --> 00:16:27.630
Nothing. You're done 
for the day, right?

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:28.990
Aren't you going home?

00:16:28.990 --> 00:16:31.420
That was my plan... Why?

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:33.650
Nothing.

00:16:34.400 --> 00:16:35.680
See you tomorrow.

00:16:36.530 --> 00:16:38.410
I'll be going, then.

00:16:40.470 --> 00:16:42.510
Let's play a game together
 again sometime.

00:16:45.490 --> 00:16:47.060
What's wrong?

00:16:49.280 --> 00:16:51.680
I have to draw a new original work

00:16:51.680 --> 00:16:54.910
in time for the next 
doujinshi exhibition,

00:16:55.690 --> 00:16:57.870
but I'm not getting any ideas.

00:16:58.270 --> 00:17:00.550
What do you mean by "original"?

00:17:01.170 --> 00:17:03.650
Something that's not a parody.

00:17:04.190 --> 00:17:07.590
I know nothing I've done up
 until now is good enough.

00:17:07.590 --> 00:17:09.890
But I don't know what to draw...

00:17:10.410 --> 00:17:12.670
Oh, are you actually 
stressing over this?

00:17:12.670 --> 00:17:13.880
You can talk to me.

00:17:14.190 --> 00:17:14.880
Shut up.

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:17.760
What?! And after I was 
worried about you!

00:17:17.760 --> 00:17:19.380
This has nothing to do with you.

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:21.060
Oh, Haru-san...

00:17:21.820 --> 00:17:23.160
Sakuya-san!

00:17:23.160 --> 00:17:24.970
Come here for a second!

00:17:26.470 --> 00:17:28.190
So that's the thing...

00:17:28.510 --> 00:17:30.190
That's right.

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:34.170
It's a secret to Nagi and 
Hayate that you're my maid.

00:17:34.170 --> 00:17:37.810
I'm sorry. After all this time, 
I got a little embarrassed...

00:17:37.810 --> 00:17:39.410
It's fine.

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:42.280
Must be rough working for Nagi, though.

00:17:42.280 --> 00:17:44.330
That manga of hers makes no sense.

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:45.400
Yes...

00:17:45.400 --> 00:17:49.540
But, I think she might actually have talent.

00:17:49.870 --> 00:17:50.780
Huh?

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:54.800
Hey, Chiharu, you're coming with 
me to look for ideas, right?

00:17:55.790 --> 00:17:57.290
Y-Yeah. I'll be right there.

00:17:57.930 --> 00:18:01.260
Hey! If you're going to think 
up ideas, I'll join you!

00:18:01.530 --> 00:18:04.020
We don't need you. You're no use to us.

00:18:05.780 --> 00:18:07.680
Okay, let's go out!

00:18:07.680 --> 00:18:09.100
Yeah, I know.

00:18:12.190 --> 00:18:16.220
Oh, Miss Nagi and 
Chiharu-san already left?

00:18:17.180 --> 00:18:20.640
Yeah... Hey, are those 
two good friends?

00:18:21.060 --> 00:18:23.120
Chiharu-san and Miss Nagi?

00:18:23.120 --> 00:18:25.690
Well, I don't know if they're friends,

00:18:25.690 --> 00:18:29.530
so much as Miss Nagi just relies 
on Chiharu-san all the time.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.750
Oh... I see...

00:18:35.020 --> 00:18:37.200
Big sis!

00:18:36.320 --> 00:18:37.840
It's all right!

00:18:39.390 --> 00:18:42.490
<i>She used to rely on me so much...</i>

00:18:42.970 --> 00:18:45.890
<i>It's sort of a complicated feeling...</i>

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:49.080
But still, darn that Nagi!

00:18:49.080 --> 00:18:51.690
What did she mean, I'm no use to them?!

00:18:51.690 --> 00:18:54.650
I'm really useful! Right?!

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:56.650
R-Right...

00:18:57.230 --> 00:19:00.540
Damn it! Then I'll show 
her how useful I am!

00:19:00.540 --> 00:19:02.070
Let me see Nagi's manga!

00:19:02.530 --> 00:19:03.420
Huh?

00:19:05.560 --> 00:19:09.050
Um... Why can this animal talk?

00:19:09.050 --> 00:19:12.210
Because it's a magic creature from 
the fifth dimension, I guess.

00:19:12.710 --> 00:19:15.550
Why are these guys fighting 
 the moment they meet?

00:19:15.550 --> 00:19:19.050
They're fated rivals who have 
traversed space and time.

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:21.660
This is kind of a difficult scenario...

00:19:21.660 --> 00:19:23.270
True.

00:19:23.270 --> 00:19:25.970
I can't really understand it,

00:19:25.970 --> 00:19:27.820
but since Haru-san said that,

00:19:27.820 --> 00:19:30.230
there must be something 
that stands out here...

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:32.310
You're no use to us.

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:37.670
Um... You don't need to force 
yourself to understand it.

00:19:37.670 --> 00:19:40.940
Miss Nagi's manga is... 
difficult to comprehend.

00:19:40.940 --> 00:19:45.160
Maybe it is, but if it can be understood,
 I want to understand it!

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:46.990
Sakuya-san...

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:50.250
Miss Nagi certainly is lucky.

00:19:50.630 --> 00:19:51.500
Huh?

00:19:52.050 --> 00:19:55.530
But if you can't understand 
something as simple as that,

00:19:55.530 --> 00:19:57.250
you are pathetic, Sakuya.

00:19:58.120 --> 00:19:59.920
Isumi-san! What are you doing here?

00:20:00.230 --> 00:20:04.180
I was going to feed the koi in the pond,
 and I ended up here for some reason.

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:06.210
What, you got lost again?

00:20:06.210 --> 00:20:07.540
It seems that way.

00:20:08.120 --> 00:20:11.600
Anyway, Isumi-san, how am I pathetic?!

00:20:12.080 --> 00:20:13.640
Listen well, Sakuya.

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:20.690
The fact that there is amusement in this 
world that you don't understand

00:20:21.250 --> 00:20:23.700
proves what a dull person you are.

00:20:24.250 --> 00:20:25.200
Wh-What?!

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:28.260
R-Really?

00:20:28.260 --> 00:20:30.930
I'm... a dull person?

00:20:31.370 --> 00:20:32.810
But don't worry.

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:37.890
With my help, even 
a dull person like you

00:20:37.890 --> 00:20:40.010
can become the sort 
of entertaining person

00:20:40.010 --> 00:20:42.630
who can understand Nagi's manga.

00:20:42.630 --> 00:20:44.130
Really?!

00:20:45.130 --> 00:20:48.120
Hey, Isumi-san... 
is this actually funny?

00:20:48.120 --> 00:20:49.890
<b>Tajadol Combo</b>

00:20:50.210 --> 00:20:53.140
Yes, quite funny.

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:56.800
<b>Tajadol Combo</b>

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:55.870
Try turning around.

00:20:55.870 --> 00:20:56.670
Like this?

00:20:56.670 --> 00:20:57.810
Dance!

00:20:57.900 --> 00:21:00.630
<b>Tajadol Combo</b>

00:21:01.090 --> 00:21:02.410
That's funny!

00:21:02.410 --> 00:21:05.370
You're looking quite funny now, Sakuya!

00:21:05.370 --> 00:21:09.120
Now, try reading Nagi's manga!

00:21:09.790 --> 00:21:13.500
Now that you're funny, 
you can understand it.

00:21:14.250 --> 00:21:15.380
All right!

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:18.210
You think this changes anything?!

00:21:18.890 --> 00:21:19.960
We're back.

00:21:20.330 --> 00:21:23.270
Oh, did Sakuya go home?

00:21:23.270 --> 00:21:26.580
Yes. She was quite troubled.

00:21:26.580 --> 00:21:28.600
Man, what's with her?

00:21:29.380 --> 00:21:33.130
I came up with some ideas, 
so I wanted her to read them.

00:21:33.130 --> 00:21:36.600
You know, because I can 
trust her intuition.

00:21:37.020 --> 00:21:39.900
I bet she would come running 
if you gave her a call.

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:41.580
You think so?

00:21:41.580 --> 00:21:45.450
Yes. She can't resist when 
people depend on her.

00:21:45.760 --> 00:21:47.610
Hey, Nagi, you're back?

00:21:47.610 --> 00:21:49.290
Oh, you were still here?

00:21:49.750 --> 00:21:52.130
We came back because 
we heard your voice.

00:21:52.600 --> 00:21:55.100
Now that Sakuya has 
grown as a manga reader,

00:21:55.100 --> 00:21:56.840
I wanted you to see her.

00:21:56.840 --> 00:21:58.750
Huh? A manga reader?

00:21:59.120 --> 00:22:01.880
Show us your new ideas.

00:22:02.590 --> 00:22:07.430
Hm... A fated rival from the 
seventh dimension appears.

00:22:07.760 --> 00:22:11.230
The sense of speed in the battle 
is amazing right from the start!

00:22:11.230 --> 00:22:14.390
You read it too, Sakuya.

00:22:14.390 --> 00:22:18.100
I think you'll be able to understand 
how interesting it is now.

00:22:18.100 --> 00:22:20.690
Hm, I see.

00:22:20.690 --> 00:22:22.570
Who can understand this?!

00:22:22.820 --> 00:22:26.700
I can't believe you don't 
see how interesting it is...

00:22:26.700 --> 00:22:29.560
Sakuya's still got a long way to go.

00:22:29.560 --> 00:22:31.370
It seems so...

00:22:31.370 --> 00:22:32.700
Hey!

00:22:33.300 --> 00:22:34.870
You listen here! I—

00:24:05.800 --> 00:24:09.070
Hey! Student Council President! Hey!

00:24:09.070 --> 00:24:09.810
I have to do this?

00:24:09.810 --> 00:24:10.850
Naturally!

00:24:10.850 --> 00:24:14.310
Otherwise you can never become the 
ultimate Cutie of the Cutie Rangers!

00:24:14.310 --> 00:24:15.360
I'm not gonna become that!

00:24:15.360 --> 00:24:16.150
Now, now...

00:24:16.150 --> 00:24:17.440
Nice Cutie!

00:24:17.440 --> 00:24:18.490
Cutie Mate!

00:24:18.490 --> 00:24:19.750
Hey!
